any later version. This port is licensed the same way: GPL-3.0-or-later.

Licence of this program: GPL-3.0-or-later. The full text is in the file LICENSE next to this one. The source code is in the
repository this package was built from; the version and the commit are printed by `chart-grabber-cli --version`.

Source code: https://github.com/Sea-For-Friends/chart-grabber-cli tag v2026.11.2

Third-party components
----------------------
Each binary package lists the third-party components it carries:
- The Windows zip (chart-grabber-cli-<version>-win64.zip) carries MSYS2 UCRT64 libraries. Its own NOTICE is written when the zip is
  built, from the packages of the DLLs it holds (name, version, licence, upstream URL; template: tools/lib/NOTICE-win64.in), and
  the licence texts are in licenses\<name>\ of the zip.
- The Linux .deb packages carry no copy of these components: they depend on the libraries of the Debian or Ubuntu release, and those
  packages ship their own copyright files (/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright).
- The self-contained Linux bundles (chart-grabber-cli-<version>-linux-<arch>.tar.gz) carry Debian 12 libraries; their own NOTICE
  lists those packages, and licenses/<package>/copyright holds the copyright file of each.
